---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About & Support — hot cocoa girl" description="About hot cocoa girl.">
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 py-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <header class="glass rounded-3xl border border-white/15 px-5 py-5 shadow-2xl shadow-slate-950/30 sm:px-7">
      <nav class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4" aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="/" class="block" aria-label="hot cocoa girl home"><img src="/profile.jpg" alt="hot cocoa girl" class="size-10 rounded-full border border-white/70 object-cover shadow-lg shadow-violet-300/30" /></a>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-slate-200 sm:gap-6"><a class="transition hover:text-white" href="/">Writing</a><a class="transition hover:text-white" href="/about">About &amp; Support</a></div>
      </nav>
    </header>
    <article class="glass mt-6 rounded-3xl border border-white/15 px-6 py-10 shadow-xl shadow-slate-950/25 sm:px-10">
      <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-violet-200">About &amp; Support</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">26 White Female Bay Area</h1>
      <div class="mt-7 space-y-5 text-base leading-8 text-slate-200">
        <p>This website is for my worldview. I love nutrition, health, psychology, economics, technology, physics, nature, skin care, beauty, philosophy, art, fashion, architecture, love, family and humans. I want to give people the knowledge/tools to understand themselves and the world, so that we can all be happier.</p>
        <p>I have a deep optimism for the future. I foresee greater knowledge, healthier people, fewer pain points, less friction with accomplishing goals and greater abundance. It will take the work of high agency people with a shared vision to get there. If you’re working hard and/or aligning people, then thank you ♥️</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
